FR:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Je viens de recevoir une lettre !{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Elle est extra, il fallait que je te la
montre !

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}It says a lot about the sender,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
doesn't it?{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:002B:}}I wish I could write
letters this expressive...

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Esta carta es tan expresiva...{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Ojalá yo supiera escribir cartas
así...

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Gönderen hakkında çok şey anlatıyor,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
değil mi?{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:002B:}}Keşke ben de bu kadar duygulu
mektuplar yazabilsem...

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Well?{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} What do you think?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:002B:}}I just loved it.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} It grabbed my heart
by the lapels and shook it.
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}If I get more letters like this one,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
I'll be sure to share them with you!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Allora? Che te ne pare?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:002B:}}Io me ne sono innamorata. {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Mi ha
letteralmente rubato il cuore.{{TAG:0003:0025:}}
Se ricevo un'altra lettera così bella,
te la faccio leggere.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Peki?{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} Ne düşünüyorsun?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:002B:}}Ben bayıldım.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Resmen kalbimi yakasından
tutup silkeledi.
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Bunun gibi başka mektuplar gelirse,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
mutlaka seninle paylaşırım!

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Oh, {{TAG:0005:0008:}} !{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Tiens, regarde la lettre que j'ai
reçue !

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}A friend sent it to me. {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}Isn't it great?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}It's not so much WHAT it says—{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}it's
HOW it says it!{{TAG:0003:0026:}}

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Che te ne pare di questa lettera?
{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Bella, eh?!{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:0000:}}Non è tanto quello che
dice,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} {{TAG:0003:0025:}}ma piuttosto come lo dice!{{TAG:0003:0026:}}

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Den hat mir ein Freund geschickt. {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0005:}}
Schön, oder?{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:0000:}}Das Tolle ist weniger
der Inhalt,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}} sondern die Worte!{{TAG:0003:0026:}}

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}I'm just so happy to have a friend
who cares enough to write me!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0004:}}This is going in my treasure box.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Sono felice di avere qualcuno che
mi scrive delle lettere così belle!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0004:}}Le conserverò per sempre!
